Package: odsql
Title: A Client for Querying Opendatasoft v2.1 APIs Using ODSQL
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ramiro", "Magno", , "rmagno@pattern.institute", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5226-3441")),
    person("Lucas", "Bicalho", , , role = "aut"),       
    person("Pattern Institute", role = c("cph", "fnd"))
  )
Description: Provides a tidy and composable interface to interact with
    Opendatasoft datasets via the Explore v2 API, using the Opendatasoft Query
    Language (ODSQL). Built on top of 'httr2', this package supports
    authentication, endpoint discovery, automatic pagination, spatial and
    faceted filtering, and conversion of responses to tibbles. Designed to
    facilitate reproducible workflows and integration with the tidyverse.
